Third-party notice

The prompt templates under `lib_ztpe/presets.py` derive from the Prompt
Enhancer of the Tongyi-MAI Z-Image-Turbo Hugging Face Space, which is
distributed under the Apache License 2.0:

    https://huggingface.co/spaces/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo

The `official` preset is a verbatim copy of that project's `pe.py`
`prompt_template`. The `official (translated)` preset is an English
translation produced by this project and is labelled as such in the UI.
